  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5KIkkxB.png\" alt=\"Logo\" width=\"1040\" height=\"320\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">這個資源包為你的世界帶來冬季主題，同時保持預設風格。若想體驗節慶版本，可以試試我的<a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/new-default-style-christmas-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>聖誕節資源包</strong></a>！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#36f\"><strong>強烈建議搭配 Continuity 或 Optifine 使用！</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>內容包含</strong>：</span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">雪取代草地（搭配 Optifine 可呈現漸層邊緣效果！）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">積雪覆蓋的樹葉（搭配 Optifine 可啟用連接材質！）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">冰霜細節裝飾</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">冬季主題介面</span></li>\n</ul><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fI3I410P9Q1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"border:0px\" src=\"https://storage.ko-fi.com/cdn/kofi2.png?v=3\" alt=\"在 ko-fi.com 請我喝杯咖啡\" width=\"196\" height=\"36\"></a></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4UV0z4K.png\" alt=\"Images\" width=\"1040\" height=\"320\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AsMkCUJ.jpg\" alt=\"Campfire\" width=\"1440\" height=\"900\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/k6zTN0F.jpg\" alt=\"Bay\" width=\"1440\" height=\"900\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9EpuAlN.jpg\" alt=\"House\" width=\"1440\" height=\"900\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8uEWUGB.jpg\" alt=\"Cherry\" width=\"1440\" height=\"808\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rGi1bap.png\" alt=\"Pairings\" width=\"1040\" height=\"179\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">以下資源包與用戶端模組能與此資源包完美搭配！</span>&nbsp;</p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:large\">[資源包] ❄️ <a style=\"font-size:18px\